    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know about \"small steps.\" it just feels like everything i used to care about is gone. my career, my purpose... it's all just dust now. it's like the world keeps moving and i'm just stuck in this weird void where i don't belong anymore. like there's no real version of me left to actually live a life. do you think it's even possible to feel like yourself again when the thing that made you \"you\" is completely dead?",
